        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a vast world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a secret-filled land in this 3D Action-Adventure, where every level is hidden in plain sight! Travel and fight through a vast, unmarked overworld. The next surprise is only a single search away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Angel's mothership, Throne, lays dormant behind a fierce storm. To reach it, unlock its secrets, and usher in the future, you must explore the land of Era and survive its trap-filled ruins, primordial forests, treacherous mountains, mines, and more! Overcome intense battles and hilarious hazards in this tale of betrayal, haunting lore, and fruitless yearning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/3ce52d7f8fb80bbed798f57f8c527a27.poster.avif?t=1783584609\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/3ce52d7f8fb80bbed798f57f8c527a27.webm?t=1783584609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/3ce52d7f8fb80bbed798f57f8c527a27.mp4?t=1783584609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, devs Melos and Marina here. Today, our hero Tets, and his ally Arkas will introduce the game, alongside the villainous Niamh!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/f41d7bbeac3b6b552aefc4552b7b1648.avif?t=1783584609\" width=600 height=266 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight bosses in thrilling Bumpslash Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TETS:</strong> I’ve spent many years practicing the <i><strong>Art of Bumpslash</strong></i> — just bump me into enemies to automatically attack! It's fast-paced, and you’ll pick it up in no time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRINCESS NIAMH:</strong> HAHAHAHA!! Tets, my dear... aren’t you giving them false hope? After all, the Fae spirit “Melos” has prepared many <i><strong>vicious and hilarious tricks</strong></i> to guard our ancient secrets! My heart swells thinking of the suffering that awaits these unsuspecting players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover secrets around every corner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANGEL ARKAS:</strong> Don’t forget the bigger picture: a <strong><i>vast world map</i></strong> you can search to find levels and zones. Follow your instincts to chart a flexible path. Go at your own pace — follow your spirit! Life's not a checklist, it’s an experience!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/90a17114d7cc33d49f7e4744769cf3af.poster.avif?t=1783584609\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/90a17114d7cc33d49f7e4744769cf3af.webm?t=1783584609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/90a17114d7cc33d49f7e4744769cf3af.mp4?t=1783584609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/fbd43005b0a57d63ec7256f8c2615d14.avif?t=1783584609\" width=600 height=266 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A moving story, both arcane and emotional</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TETS:</strong> Agreed! I can’t wait to escape into this world’s <i><strong>haunting lore</strong></i>, woven from Irish mythology, early Christian philosophy, and Japanese American history. By poring over ancient texts and researching on-location, Melos and Marina have grounded their world in truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANGEL ARKAS:</strong> Truth is not limited to dusty details, Tets. You've forgotten about Angeline Era's tales of <i><strong>fruitless yearning, life-shattering betrayal </strong></i>and<strong><i> unsettling beauty</i></strong>! Only the truths of the heart will bring forth the future...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRINCESS NIAMH:</strong> What on earth are you two going on about? This is an action game. <i><strong>KILL, KILL!!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/a564f0c595ae6e7eb842dabbc4a9c60b.poster.avif?t=1783584609\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/a564f0c595ae6e7eb842dabbc4a9c60b.webm?t=1783584609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/a564f0c595ae6e7eb842dabbc4a9c60b.mp4?t=1783584609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a secret-filled land in this 3D Action-Adventure, where every level is hidden in plain sight! Travel and fight through a vast, unmarked overworld. The next surprise is only a single search away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bump the World!&quot; with intuitive <strong>Bumpslash Combat</strong>. Walk into enemies to attack - no button needed! Fast-paced action levels AND exploration-and-lore focused levels will test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fearsome Fae forests, condemned buildings, trap-filled farms, spiritual mountains sites, mines, towns, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce and uniquely designed bosses and enemies that will test your Bumpslash skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow wandering ex-soldier, Tets Kinoshta, as he allies with the Angel, Arkas Gemini, attempting to breach the storm guarding Throne: the Angel's crashed mothership. Will they unlock its secrets?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of levels, each offering glimpses into the Fae, Angels and Humans living together in the country of Era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix up combat with subweapons and a gun, and visit towns to shop for items. Beat levels to get Scales and level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On average, a first playthrough takes 20-30 hours, depending on how much of the world you want to explore and how fast you play. (Rushed playthroughs may be less - I've seen as low as 15-16, thorough playthroughs may be over 30)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-difficulty setting for Beginner Bumpslashers, and nightmarish settings for the deranged!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Anodyne 2 and Sephonie's devs, Melos and Marina.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393920/extras/800a4e1d996fd703c1551b074d2b5ca9.avif?t=1783584609\" width=600 height=320 /></span></p>",
